nce. At our doors are all kinds of precious fruits, new and old, which I have stored up for you, my beloved.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Jeremiah 16:17","note":"For my eyes are on all their ways. They are not hidden from my face. Their iniquity isn’t concealed from my eyes.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezekiel 7:22","note":"I will also turn my face from them, and they will profane my secret place. Robbers will enter into it, and profane it.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}